[106.898694, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[108.131685, "o", "Presidio analyzer: 20 recognizers loaded (3 of them added by the lab: IN_PAN, IN_AADHAAR, AWS_ACCESS_KEY)\r\n\r\n  finds                how                                      context words that raise the score\r\n  AWS_ACCESS_KEY       pattern, start 0.9                       -\r\n  CREDIT_CARD          pattern + validity check, start 0.3      credit, card, visa\r\n  CRYPTO               pattern + validity check, start 0.5      wallet, btc, bitcoin\r\n  DATE_TIME            pattern, start 0.1/0.2/0.6/0.8           date, birthday\r\n  EMAIL_ADDRESS        pattern + validity check, start 0.5      email\r\n  IBAN_CODE            pattern + validity check, start 0.5      iban, bank, transaction\r\n  IN_AADHAAR           pattern + validity check, start 0.01     aadhaar, uidai\r\n"]
[108.131761, "o", "  IN_PAN               pattern, start 0.01/0.1/0.5              permanent account number, pan\r\n  IP_ADDRESS           pattern, start 0.1/0.6                   ip, ipv4, ipv6\r\n  MAC_ADDRESS          pattern, start 0.6                       mac, mac address, hardware address\r\n  MEDICAL_LICENSE      pattern + validity check, start 0.4      medical, certificate, DEA\r\n  PERSON, LOCATION...  language model guess (spaCy NER)         -\r\n  PHONE_NUMBER         phone library parses the number          phone, number, telephone\r\n"]
[108.131918, "o", "  UK_NHS               pattern + validity check, start 0.5      national health service, nhs, health se…\r\n  URL                  pattern, start 0.5/0.6                   url, website, link\r\n  US_BANK_NUMBER       pattern, start 0.05                      check, account, account#\r\n  US_DRIVER_LICENSE    pattern, start 0.01/0.3                  driver, license, permit\r\n  US_ITIN              pattern, start 0.05/0.3/0.5              individual, taxpayer, itin\r\n  US_PASSPORT          pattern, start 0.05/0.1                  us, united, states\r\n  US_SSN               pattern, start 0.05/0.5                  social, security, ssn\r\n\r\nthe lab redacts only these 10 types (ENTITIES in redactor.py), and only when the score is at least 0.35:\r\n  PERSON, EMAIL_ADDRESS, PHONE_NUMBER, CREDIT_CARD, IBAN_CODE, IP_ADDRESS, US_SSN, IN_PAN, IN_AADHAAR, AWS_ACCESS_KEY\r\n"]
